    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OUTGUNNED! is a fast-pased action-platformer set in a cyberpunk dystopia where cats are the dominant species. Topple the corporation as one of the 3 playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based combat: Enemies ragdoll realistically and have different reactions for player actions allowing creative approach to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character abilities:\u00a0Play as a few different characters with unique abilities and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big weaponry: There are many different weapons with unique mechanics like smart guns or ricochet focused guns.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes: Experience the story as well as roguelike style game mode</p>",
